[?1049h[?1l=[r[?1000l[?1002l[?1003l[?1005l[?1006l[?12l[>1u[?2031h[?996n[?2004h[?1004hP26661nCgkKBGJlYW0SAQE=\[14t[16t]11;?\]10;?\[?2026$p_Ga=q,i=31,s=1,v=1,t=d,f=24;AAAA\[c[?1000h[?1002h[?1003h[?1015h[?1006h[?25l[2;1H[m[m]8;;\                                                                                                                                                                                                                [3;1H[m[38;2;215;119;87m[49m[59m[29m[28m[27m[25m[25m[22m[24m[22m[23m]8;;\ ▐[48;2;0;0;0m▛███▛█[m]8;;\   [1mClaude Code[m]8;;\ [38;2;153;153;153mv2.1.319[m]8;;\                                                                                                                                                                                 [4;1H[m[38;2;215;119;87m[49m[59m[29m[28m[27m[25m[25m[22m[24m[22m[23m]8;;\▝▜[48;2;0;0;0m█████[49m█▀[m]8;;\  [38;2;153;153;153mSonnet 5 · Amazon Bedrock (Mantle)[m]8;;\                                                                                                                                                                   [5;1H[m[38;2;215;119;87m[49m[59m[29m[28m[27m[25m[25m[22m[24m[22m[23m]8;;\ ▝▝   ▝▝ [m]8;;\  [38;2;153;153;153m/home/beams[m]8;;\                                                                                                                                                                                          [6;1H[m[m]8;;\                                                                                                                                                                                                                [7;1H[m[38;2;215;119;87m[49m[59m[29m[28m[27m[25m[25m[22m[24m[22m[23m]8;;\▎[m]8;;\ [1mAuto mode is now Claude Code's default permission mode.[m]8;;\                                                                                                                                                       [8;1H[m[38;2;215;119;87m[49m[59m[29m[28m[27m[25m[25m[22m[24m[22m[23m]8;;\▎[m]8;;\ [38;2;153;153;153mAuto mode lets Claude handle permission prompts automatically. Claude checks each tool call for risky actions and prompt injection before executing, runs the ones it assesses as lower-risk, and blocks the [m]8;;\ [9;1H[m[38;2;215;119;87m[49m[59m[29m[28m[27m[25m[25m[22m[24m[22m[23m]8;;\▎[m]8;;\ [38;2;153;153;153mrest.[m]8;;\                                                                                                                                                                                                         [10;1H[m[38;2;215;119;87m[49m[59m[29m[28m[27m[25m[25m[22m[24m[22m[23m]8;;\▎[m]8;;\ [38;2;153;153;153m]8;id=0;https://code.claude.com/docs/en/permission-modes\https://code.claude.com/docs/en/permission-modes[m]8;;\                                                                                                                                                              [11;1H[m[m]8;;\  [38;2;153;153;153m1 more notice hidden[m]8;;\                                                                                                                                                                                          [12;1H[m[m]8;;\                                                                                                                                                                                                                [13;1H[m[38;2;153;153;153m[48;2;55;55;55m[59m[29m[28m[27m[25m[25m[22m[24m[22m[23m]8;;\❯ [38;2;255;255;255mCan you explain what a VT100 emulator is in a short paragraph?[39m                                                                                                                                                [14;1H[m[m]8;;\                                                                                                                                                                                                                [15;1H[m[38;2;255;255;255m[49m[59m[29m[28m[27m[25m[25m[22m[24m[22m[23m]8;;\●[m]8;;\ A VT100 emulator is software that mimics the behavior of the DEC VT100, a physical computer terminal from 1978 that displayed text sent over a serial connection and interpreted special escape-code sequences[16;1H[m[m]8;;\  for things like cursor movement, text formatting, and screen clearing. Modern terminal emulators (like the one in your OS, or terminal apps such as iTerm2, Windows Terminal, or the one underlying this CLI) [17;1H[m[m]8;;\  implement VT100 (and its descendants, like VT220 or the broader ANSI/xterm standards) so that command-line programs can still use those same escape codes to control colors, position text, draw interfaces,  [18;1H[m[m]8;;\  and so on — even though there's no physical terminal hardware involved anymore.                                                                                                                               [19;1H[m[m]8;;\                                                                                                                                                                                                                [20;1H[m[38;2;153;153;153m[49m[59m[29m[28m[27m[25m[25m[22m[24m[22m[23m]8;;\✻[m]8;;\ [38;2;153;153;153mSautéed for 4s · done 5:09 AM[m]8;;\                                                                                                                                                                                 [21;1H[m[m]8;;\                                                                                                                                                                                                                [22;1H[m[m]8;;\     